    "description": "This is about behaviour. Details aren’t aesthetic. They’re structural.\n\nEnvironment decides more than effort ever will.\nThe people around you.\nThe space you live in.\nThe food you feed your body.\nThe inputs you consume daily.\n\nStart small — shift one space, one habit, one circle. What aligns will stay. What doesn’t will fall away.\n\nPay attention to what nurtures you. Don’t force growth. Fix the soil friends. \n\n#DetailsMatter #IntentionalLiving #Fails #DesignYourLife\n#Sourdough",
